00:01:56.220 --> 00:01:59.300
Koganei siblings versus the united Inuzuka team.

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:02.000
The second round to determine who's stronger.

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:03.790
Western Branch Shindara Rettetsu Style
Koganei Tenten

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:06.240
Who is going to represent the Inuzuka team?

00:02:06.830 --> 00:02:08.810
So the next opponent is her.

00:02:09.380 --> 00:02:10.380
I'll go.

00:02:12.080 --> 00:02:13.080
Iroha-dono...

00:02:14.310 --> 00:02:15.940
I'll definitely win.

00:02:16.630 --> 00:02:18.110
For you guys.

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:21.560
And to avenge my clan.

00:02:23.160 --> 00:02:25.670
Ten years ago, in front of the carefree me...

00:02:26.300 --> 00:02:27.520
...she appeared.

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:29.500
That witch.

00:02:30.160 --> 00:02:31.980
<i>Nice to meet you, Iroha-chan.</i>

00:02:32.520 --> 00:02:34.530
Okay, Tenten onee-chan.

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:40.400
At the beginning, she was the kind onee-chan from the Koganei clan who always comes to play...

00:02:41.150 --> 00:02:42.280
...or so that was that I thought.

00:02:43.410 --> 00:02:43.910
However...

00:02:44.320 --> 00:02:46.520
After smiling for eight years.

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:48.310
Our clan's techniques,

00:02:48.720 --> 00:02:49.530
medicines,

00:02:49.750 --> 00:02:50.910
even our clan members...

00:02:52.390 --> 00:02:54.960
When I noticed that the smile was actually the grin of a witch...

00:02:55.720 --> 00:02:57.880
It was when I have already lost everything.

00:02:59.390 --> 00:03:01.310
She is the culprit who destroyed the Miyamoto group.

00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:03.130
So that's what happened...

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:07.770
And the ones who burned Koushi-kun's house are Tenten-san's subordinates.

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:09.250
What?

00:03:09.940 --> 00:03:11.540
The enemy of our clan...

00:03:12.230 --> 00:03:14.930
And to avenge senpai's...

00:03:16.470 --> 00:03:19.800
Koganei Tenten, I will defeat you!

00:03:20.080 --> 00:03:21.590
I've been waiting for this.

00:03:23.030 --> 00:03:24.320
How nice.

00:03:26.420 --> 00:03:29.320
My heart is beating in excitement.

00:03:30.660 --> 00:03:36.220
"The assassination of Inuzuka Koushi"? "The twelve shinshou"? "The pride of the Koganei clan"?

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:38.670
I don't care about any of them.

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:41.180
Who I am most interested in is...

00:03:41.520 --> 00:03:43.600
...Mi-ya-mo-to...

00:03:43.970 --> 00:03:46.050
...Iroha-chan!

00:03:46.860 --> 00:03:48.120
It's you!

00:03:48.650 --> 00:03:53.640
Thoughts About Each Other

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:59.170
The second round, Koganei Tenten vs Miyamoto Iroha, is starting.

00:03:59.610 --> 00:04:02.030
The rule is to have a death match with whatever mean possible.

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:04.980
You can use any weapon you want.

00:04:05.670 --> 00:04:06.330
Weapon?

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:08.780
These are my weapons.

00:04:18.290 --> 00:04:20.170
I'm using my subordinates as weapons.

00:04:20.490 --> 00:04:24.130
Iroha-chan should use Hanzo-chan to have a group fight with us.

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:25.480
Tiger vs snake.

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:28.430
It's the final battle between the two top female fighters of our clans.

00:04:28.900 --> 00:04:30.380
Isn't it exciting?

00:04:30.850 --> 00:04:31.880
That's unfair!

00:04:32.010 --> 00:04:33.450
You have more people!

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:38.010
These men were all once Miyamoto clan members.

00:04:39.610 --> 00:04:44.100
Now they are all controlled and became puppets of the tiger, how sad.

00:04:51.660 --> 00:04:53.770
I'll liberate you all.

00:04:54.390 --> 00:04:55.490
Let's go, Hanzo.

00:04:57.850 --> 00:04:58.540
Okay, sis.

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:00.450
Strength is not in numbers.

00:05:06.540 --> 00:05:08.580
The faith that connects us together...

00:05:09.060 --> 00:05:12.850
If you think you can take that away from us, give it a try, Koganei Tenten!

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:19.860
Bombs!

00:05:22.240 --> 00:05:23.060
Not good enough!

00:05:25.850 --> 00:05:26.980
Where are they?

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:33.890
They are surrounded.

00:05:35.110 --> 00:05:36.020
How silly.

00:05:36.530 --> 00:05:37.370
This is not good.

00:05:37.720 --> 00:05:39.510
Now what are you going to do, Iroha-chan?

00:05:44.910 --> 00:05:45.850
Why?

00:05:46.100 --> 00:05:49.400
Why is she so calm even under this situation?

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:53.260
That's because there is someone watching over my back.

00:05:55.300 --> 00:05:56.870
Miyamoto group was disbanded.

00:05:57.250 --> 00:06:00.640
We're constantly trying to find a chance to revive the clan.

00:06:01.110 --> 00:06:04.340
We have been surrounded countless times like this in the past.

00:06:04.940 --> 00:06:06.350
I was able to go through them every time...

00:06:08.770 --> 00:06:11.940
That's because you are always beside me.

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:13.290
Hanzo.

00:06:16.650 --> 00:06:20.610
When I was left alone, you were the only one who didn't leave me.

00:06:21.390 --> 00:06:23.210
You never made fun of me.

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:29.400
I want to return your trust that made you believe in me and follow me.

00:06:30.210 --> 00:06:33.480
I'm overflowing with strength every time I think about it.

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:35.170
I can be stronger!

00:06:35.990 --> 00:06:39.380
I won't bow to anything as long as you are behind me.

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:40.700
Let's do it.

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:43.340
Indara Jyaei Genma style, ultimate technique.

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:45.130
Combo technique.

00:06:45.280 --> 00:06:48.830
Nidouryuu, Madara Mangetsukiri.

00:06:45.280 --> 00:06:48.830
Translation: Twin sword style, demon's full moon slash.

00:06:56.210 --> 00:06:56.960
They did it!

00:06:57.400 --> 00:06:59.820
What amazing trust and unity.

00:07:04.280 --> 00:07:05.750
They can still stand?

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:06.920
It's alright.

00:07:06.980 --> 00:07:08.990
I won't let them lay a finger on sis.

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:11.910
Idiot, that's my line.

00:07:14.760 --> 00:07:15.610
Is that how it is...

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:18.190
I'm disgusted.

00:07:18.340 --> 00:07:21.140
Doing that in the middle of a duel.

00:07:21.610 --> 00:07:23.650
What are you implying?

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:26.850
I'm telling you to stop showing off.

00:07:27.170 --> 00:07:31.000
Aren't you embarrassed? To have an affair with your subordinate.

00:07:32.190 --> 00:07:34.230
You are the one who should be embarrassed.

00:07:34.700 --> 00:07:36.180
You fool.

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:39.000
How dare you insult the trust between gangsters.

00:07:40.260 --> 00:07:44.280
Those who drank from the cup are like blood relatives.

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:47.640
Hanzo and I are like son and mother, brother and sister!

00:07:48.010 --> 00:07:51.590
Worldly relationships like love and romance...

00:07:51.690 --> 00:07:54.290
...can never exist between us!

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:57.090
Really?

00:07:57.530 --> 00:07:58.310
That's right.

00:07:58.750 --> 00:07:59.720
Right, Hanzo?

00:08:03.680 --> 00:08:05.530
You are right, sis.

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:08.110
I'm sis' subordinate.

00:08:09.080 --> 00:08:10.400
I can never be anything more than that.

00:08:11.060 --> 00:08:11.810
I understand that...

00:08:12.820 --> 00:08:16.110
But I can't stop my tears when you tell me straight in the face like that.

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:22.960
So it's just as I thought.

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:25.340
What's happening?

00:08:25.780 --> 00:08:26.320
What?

00:08:26.720 --> 00:08:30.210
Hanzo-dono's battle aura is getting weaker.

00:08:34.130 --> 00:08:35.080
Okay!

00:08:35.110 --> 00:08:36.800
Stop, stop!

00:08:37.150 --> 00:08:41.200
Sorry to interrupt you in the middle of a fight, but I take back my joke earlier.

00:08:41.390 --> 00:08:42.110
"Joke"?

00:08:42.450 --> 00:08:45.250
I always knew.

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:48.580
There is nothing between Iroha-chan and Hanzo-chan.

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:50.620
That's what I said!

00:08:50.990 --> 00:08:54.570
Iroha-chan loves someone else, right?

00:08:55.140 --> 00:08:56.900
What do you want to say?

00:08:57.270 --> 00:08:58.500
You mean I can say it?

00:08:58.870 --> 00:08:59.780
I'll say it.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:02.200
The person Iroha-chan loves is...

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:06.090
The person Iroha-chan loves is...!

00:09:06.160 --> 00:09:07.350
Oh my god!

00:09:07.820 --> 00:09:09.080
It's you!

00:09:12.750 --> 00:09:14.880
Inuzuka Koushi-chan!

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:23.830
Iroha-dono...

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:26.530
Koushi-dono...?

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:28.640
No!

00:09:28.980 --> 00:09:29.480
No!

00:09:29.520 --> 00:09:30.050
No!

00:09:31.620 --> 00:09:32.870
Sis, calm down!

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:34.980
My my...

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:37.520
Your combination is breaking apart.

00:09:38.490 --> 00:09:40.060
Just as I thought.

00:09:40.660 --> 00:09:42.760
You were feeling jealous back then, weren't you?

00:09:43.360 --> 00:09:44.680
Koushi-chan.

00:09:44.840 --> 00:09:47.250
What do you think of Iroha-chan?

00:09:47.470 --> 00:09:50.170
Do you like her better than your wife?

00:09:51.340 --> 00:09:52.650
Missus!

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:57.830
Note: Kouhai means lower grade man, the opposite of senpai.

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:57.830
The kouhai you believed so much in is after your husband.

00:09:57.870 --> 00:10:00.380
Please tell us your thoughts!

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:02.670
Momoko... senpai...

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:10.860
Senpai, I love you.

00:10:11.300 --> 00:10:13.940
Senpai's, I love you both.

00:10:14.660 --> 00:10:16.770
I love you, but I...

00:10:17.650 --> 00:10:21.290
We played, talked, and laughed.

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:26.120
We can never go back now...

00:10:31.740 --> 00:10:32.460
How dare you...

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:35.890
How dare you!

00:10:35.890 --> 00:10:37.680
Mikazuki giri!

00:10:40.600 --> 00:10:41.630
She snapped.

00:10:42.700 --> 00:10:44.930
Though I only peeked at the secret scroll for a bit.

00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:47.310
Let me teach you.

00:10:47.500 --> 00:10:50.610
This is how you perform a mikazuki giri.

00:10:52.340 --> 00:10:53.220
No way...

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:08.350
She's strong...

00:11:18.080 --> 00:11:19.840
Hey, don't sleep.

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:22.350
I haven't had enough fun yet.

00:11:26.560 --> 00:11:28.190
This brings back memories.

00:11:28.660 --> 00:11:32.650
We used to talk like this all the time.

00:11:33.650 --> 00:11:34.940
Hey, Iroha-chan.

00:11:35.480 --> 00:11:37.670
Which part of Koushi-chan do you like?

00:11:38.020 --> 00:11:38.620
His face?

00:11:38.870 --> 00:11:40.090
Or his personality?

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:43.610
I'm sure Koushi-chan is like a charming big brother, right?

00:11:44.270 --> 00:11:47.030
Iroha-chan was such a spoiled girl.

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:52.020
But there is no one to spoil you now.

00:11:56.230 --> 00:11:59.460
Facing the gentleness of a big brother when you were lonely...

00:12:00.750 --> 00:12:02.380
You would fall for him, wouldn't you?

00:12:03.290 --> 00:12:04.230
Am I right?

00:12:04.860 --> 00:12:05.770
There is no helping it.

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:08.940
Anyone would fall for him.

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:10.730
Onii-chan...

00:12:12.590 --> 00:12:13.940
Hey, Iroha-chan.

00:12:14.280 --> 00:12:16.510
What do you want to happen between you and Koushi-chan?

00:12:18.330 --> 00:12:19.650
Do you want to go on a date with him?

00:12:20.400 --> 00:12:21.410
Do you want to hold his hand...

00:12:22.950 --> 00:12:24.360
...be touched...

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:27.440
...and kiss him?

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:30.510
Am I right?

00:12:30.580 --> 00:12:31.890
You do, don't you?

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:33.210
No...

00:12:33.370 --> 00:12:34.780
Don't lie to me.

00:12:35.250 --> 00:12:37.640
You want him to do nasty things to you, right?

00:12:38.080 --> 00:12:40.030
Right, right, Iroha-chan?

00:12:40.720 --> 00:12:42.730
I don't... I don't...

00:12:42.910 --> 00:12:44.550
Stop it...

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:46.710
Stop!

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:53.750
Get your dirty hands off of sis!

00:12:55.380 --> 00:13:01.220
I said to get your hands off of sis, you bitch!

00:13:01.370 --> 00:13:02.570
"Bitch"?

00:13:03.160 --> 00:13:06.900
Is that how you ask someone a favor, Hanzo-chan?

00:13:08.500 --> 00:13:11.610
Tenten-san, let go of sis.

00:13:13.400 --> 00:13:14.310
Stop!

00:13:14.620 --> 00:13:16.130
I don't get it.

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:18.360
Why are you wasting your time on this girl?

00:13:18.640 --> 00:13:20.460
She loves Koushi-chan.

00:13:21.500 --> 00:13:23.600
Who said anything about love?

00:13:23.850 --> 00:13:25.740
Don't make up your own mind like that.

00:13:26.050 --> 00:13:28.120
Do you not understand?

00:13:28.560 --> 00:13:29.410
I don't understand.

00:13:29.880 --> 00:13:31.480
I don't get it at all.

00:13:32.390 --> 00:13:34.280
Neither do I.

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:35.310
Tenten-san.

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:38.080
Why do you hate sis so much?

00:13:38.740 --> 00:13:39.990
I wonder.

00:13:40.560 --> 00:13:41.560
This is weird.

00:13:41.720 --> 00:13:44.100
You weren't like this the first time we met.

00:13:44.580 --> 00:13:46.140
The first time, huh?

00:13:46.770 --> 00:13:49.820
I was living at Iroha-chan's house at that time.

00:13:50.350 --> 00:13:54.310
You were wondering around in your personal cloth, I thought you were a lost guest.

00:13:56.600 --> 00:13:58.480
The group members were starting to leave.

00:13:58.830 --> 00:14:00.870
Well, that's because I was pulling the strings.

00:14:01.370 --> 00:14:04.790
As long as I kept on smiling, no one knew what I was really thinking.

00:14:05.360 --> 00:14:06.830
Neither was there anyone who tried to understand me.

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:09.720
It was so irritating.

00:14:10.070 --> 00:14:11.070
<i>Uh...</i>

00:14:11.480 --> 00:14:13.550
<i>Are you angry by any chance?</i>

00:14:15.310 --> 00:14:17.010
<i>Hey brat!</i>

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:18.890
<i>What kind of idiotic nonsense are you saying to Tenten-san?</i>

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:20.370
<i>I-I'm sorry...</i>

00:14:21.120 --> 00:14:23.000
<i>You guys are the idiots.</i>

00:14:23.760 --> 00:14:26.960
You were a nice boy, Hanzo-chan.

00:14:25.200 --> 00:14:26.330
<i>You are right.</i>

00:14:27.650 --> 00:14:28.870
But I never thought of it.

00:14:29.750 --> 00:14:34.120
I didn't know you were already Iroha-chan's subordinate.

00:14:34.750 --> 00:14:38.170
<i>Starting today, you are my subordinate Hanzo, you will live and work here.</i>

00:14:38.800 --> 00:14:40.870
<i>Come on, greet your sis.</i>

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:42.780
<i>Yes, sis!</i>

00:14:43.720 --> 00:14:45.550
So what?

00:14:45.920 --> 00:14:48.430
That has nothing to do with what I'm saying.

00:14:49.090 --> 00:14:50.910
What I wanted to know is why you hate...

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:54.020
Shit...

00:14:54.680 --> 00:14:56.190
Hanzo-chan, you are so stupid.

00:14:56.630 --> 00:15:00.400
All these men accepted my offers to become my subordinates.

00:15:00.680 --> 00:15:02.090
Yet you refused.

00:15:02.690 --> 00:15:04.380
Considering that our clan had more money.

00:15:05.140 --> 00:15:06.200
What a fool.

00:15:06.580 --> 00:15:12.890
If you became my subordinate, you could've become more happy than you can imagine.

00:15:13.210 --> 00:15:14.520
Like these guys.

00:15:17.380 --> 00:15:18.480
Are you sure?

00:15:28.120 --> 00:15:31.950
To work for someone who uses drugs to control her subordinates?

00:15:32.420 --> 00:15:33.610
No thanks.

00:15:33.930 --> 00:15:38.950
Besides, I have no intention to follow someone else even if I die.

00:15:40.680 --> 00:15:42.000
Then why don't you just die?

00:15:43.090 --> 00:15:43.850
I stole...

00:15:44.700 --> 00:15:46.300
I robbed and looted...

00:15:47.770 --> 00:15:50.630
It's all because you kept on showing off what I don't have!

00:15:57.720 --> 00:15:58.480
Sis!

00:15:59.360 --> 00:16:01.960
Let's settle the scores, Koganei Tenten!

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:05.290
It's useless.

00:16:05.510 --> 00:16:08.120
I have my shields, your attacks won't reach me.

00:16:08.590 --> 00:16:11.480
You guys are pathetic, is that how gangsters should act?

00:16:11.980 --> 00:16:12.580
Stay back!

00:16:16.470 --> 00:16:17.580
Amazing!

00:16:17.790 --> 00:16:21.180
Iroha-dono is an amazing martial artist who was born to be a leader.

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:25.350
Her spirit is shouldering the fate of her entire clan.

00:16:26.610 --> 00:16:28.370
I know that stance too.

00:16:28.650 --> 00:16:30.250
Want me to imitate it again?

00:16:30.660 --> 00:16:32.730
With a little Koganei flavor, that is.

00:16:38.290 --> 00:16:39.200
But...

00:16:39.760 --> 00:16:41.550
The enemy is just too...

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:48.370
Sousatsu Madara Giri!

00:17:05.820 --> 00:17:06.730
I'm out of strength.

00:17:07.140 --> 00:17:09.280
I'm sorry, my clan members.

00:17:19.790 --> 00:17:21.050
Momoko senpai...

00:17:24.660 --> 00:17:25.630
This is the end.

00:17:25.850 --> 00:17:28.140
We've lost this round.

00:17:32.510 --> 00:17:33.760
Uh...

00:17:33.890 --> 00:17:35.550
For the time being...

00:17:35.650 --> 00:17:36.370
Koushi-dono.

00:17:36.870 --> 00:17:38.850
This is a conversation between girls.

00:17:39.320 --> 00:17:40.300
I'm so scared!

00:17:40.300 --> 00:17:41.550
But this is so exciting.

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:45.510
There is nothing more fun than exposing one's true feelings.

00:17:50.220 --> 00:17:51.600
As a woman...

00:17:52.190 --> 00:17:53.860
I can't forgive you.

00:17:54.300 --> 00:17:56.750
Oh come on, don't be angry.

00:17:56.970 --> 00:17:59.670
But you are actually angry at Iroha-chan, aren't you?

00:17:59.950 --> 00:18:02.680
You don't want to share your loved one, do you?

00:18:02.900 --> 00:18:04.880
It's gonna be worse if he's taken from you, right?

00:18:04.940 --> 00:18:06.260
This is so idiotic.

00:18:06.510 --> 00:18:10.030
Falling in love will only get yourself hurt.

00:18:10.060 --> 00:18:11.940
That's why it's so much fun to pick on little girls...

00:18:13.070 --> 00:18:15.710
Don't you dare belittle a woman's heart any further!

00:18:16.020 --> 00:18:17.400
It's fun to pick on others?

00:18:17.620 --> 00:18:18.910
You gotta be kidding!

00:18:19.480 --> 00:18:22.050
If only you can understand the pain of falling in love...

00:18:22.550 --> 00:18:24.470
Your heart would also be in pain!

00:18:24.880 --> 00:18:26.540
Because you are also a woman!

00:18:34.330 --> 00:18:36.180
Close match.

00:18:36.370 --> 00:18:38.000
But are you alright?

00:18:41.740 --> 00:18:42.840
I'm sorry.

00:18:43.180 --> 00:18:47.330
My inexperience has caused you a lot of pain.

00:18:48.610 --> 00:18:50.460
Momoko senpai is not at fault!

00:18:50.780 --> 00:18:53.290
Because you two are almost like husband and wife...

00:18:53.790 --> 00:18:54.480
I...

00:18:54.860 --> 00:18:55.740
I'm sorry.

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:57.470
It's okay.

00:18:57.910 --> 00:19:01.140
Because we are not husband and wife.

00:19:03.780 --> 00:19:09.580
Koushi-dono never said he loves me nor ever addressed me as wife.

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:13.380
Everything is just my one-sided feelings.

00:19:13.540 --> 00:19:15.900
There is nothing to worry about.

00:19:16.620 --> 00:19:17.280
She...

00:19:18.750 --> 00:19:21.390
So this is what she was thinking behind her smiles.

00:19:21.990 --> 00:19:22.870
Iroha-dono.

00:19:23.210 --> 00:19:25.350
There is no holding back in a fight.

00:19:25.410 --> 00:19:26.480
"A fight"?

00:19:27.010 --> 00:19:27.890
Indeed.

00:19:28.200 --> 00:19:32.030
This is the fight to win a man's heart.

00:19:32.470 --> 00:19:34.420
It's a fight with your life at risk.

00:19:34.800 --> 00:19:36.990
The fight for love...?

00:19:37.590 --> 00:19:38.310
That's right.

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:41.800
If you hold back, I can't guarantee your safety.

00:19:42.300 --> 00:19:44.340
Who will win Koushi-dono's love...

00:19:45.160 --> 00:19:46.760
When this fight is over...

00:19:47.510 --> 00:19:48.450
Let's fight for it.

00:19:49.830 --> 00:19:51.310
Yes, Momoko senpai!

00:19:54.580 --> 00:19:56.710
I can never act like that.

00:19:58.470 --> 00:20:00.040
I can mess around...

00:20:00.670 --> 00:20:02.740
I can also lie...

00:20:03.710 --> 00:20:05.000
But my true feeling is...

00:20:05.810 --> 00:20:06.850
That's why at that time...

00:20:07.230 --> 00:20:09.240
When you were able to understand me...

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:10.960
I felt happy.

00:20:23.330 --> 00:20:24.210
Tenten-san...

00:20:31.680 --> 00:20:32.630
Hey!

00:20:34.920 --> 00:20:35.610
Tenka-kun!

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:38.090
What happened to Momoko and Inuzuka?

00:20:38.690 --> 00:20:39.630
They already left.

00:20:40.260 --> 00:20:41.890
To end everything.

00:20:48.320 --> 00:20:50.590
